@startuml UC70_BookingNotification
!theme plain
title UC70: Gửi thông báo đặt phòng

actor System
participant "Backend Service" as Service
participant "Socket.IO" as Socket
database "Database" as DB

System -> Service: Event: Booking mới / Cập nhật\n(bookingId, action: new_booking/booking_updated)
Service -> DB: Tìm booking theo ID\n(populate customer, room)
DB --> Service: Booking data

Service -> DB: Tạo notification\n(type: new_booking/booking_updated, recipients: admin/staff)
Service -> DB: Set recipients\n(role: admin, staff, read: false)
DB --> Service: Notification created

Service -> Socket: Emit "new_booking" / "booking_updated"\n(booking data, notification message)
Socket -> Socket: Broadcast đến rooms\n(role:admin, role:staff)
Socket --> Frontend: Real-time notification\n(tất cả admin/staff online)

Frontend -> Frontend: Update UI\n(badge unread, notification list)
Frontend --> Staff: Hiển thị notification\n(toast, badge, sound)

note right
  Notification bao gồm:
  - Booking ID, customer info
  - Room, check-in/out dates
  - Total price, payment status
  - Source (online/walk_in)
end note
@enduml

